  "statement": "# Last Cat on the Wall — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nDefend a ruined street as a lone armed cat, make readable tactical choices under pressure, then leave the defended area through a short traversal coda.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact 2D lane-defence action game with a complete beginning, defence phase, success/failure ending, and replay path.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the exact street layout, wave composition, economy numbers, feedback, and art arrangement from the supplied palette.\n"
